const passportDefaults=['旅客 1','旅客 2','旅客 3','旅客 4'].map(label=>({label,englishName:'',passportNumber:'',birthDate:'',expiryDate:'',nationality:'TWN',sex:''}));let state, storageBlocked=false, lastSaved=null;
function notify(message){document.getElementById('status').textContent=message}
function validate(data){
 if(!data||typeof data!=='object'||!Object.keys(init).every(k=>Array.isArray(data[k])))throw Error('資料格式不符：缺少必要清單');
 for(const k of Object.keys(init)){const ids=new Set();for(const x of data[k]){
  if(!x||typeof x!=='object'||typeof x.name!=='string'||typeof x.id!=='string'||!/^[-a-zA-Z0-9_]+$/.test(x.id)||ids.has(x.id))throw Error('項目名稱或識別碼無效');
  ids.add(x.id);if(k==='itinerary'&&![UNSCHEDULED,...days].includes(x.day))throw Error('行程日期無效');
 }}
 if(data.passports!==undefined&&(!Array.isArray(data.passports)||data.passports.some(p=>!p||typeof p!=='object')))throw Error('護照格式無效');
 return data;
}
try{const raw=localStorage.getItem(KEY);state=raw?validate(JSON.parse(raw)):structuredClone(init);lastSaved=JSON.stringify(state)}catch(error){storageBlocked=true;state=structuredClone(init);notify('無法讀取既有資料，已停止寫入。請保留原瀏覽器資料，先匯出原始資料再排除問題。')}
if(!Array.isArray(state.passports))state.passports=structuredClone(passportDefaults);
for(const [i,p] of state.passports.entries())if(!p.label)p.label=passportDefaults[i]?.label||'旅客';
if(!storageBlocked)lastSaved=JSON.stringify(state);
// 不自動加入或移除任何既有清單項目。
let passportVisible=false;let tab='itinerary';let dayFilter='all',areaFilter='all';const tabs=[['itinerary','行程'],['map','地圖'],['dayone','12/3機場到旅館'],['return','12/10旅館到機場'],['standby','備用行程'],['prep','行前準備'],['arrival','抵達日本'],['restaurants','餐廳'],['shopping','購物'],['entry','入境資料']];const esc=s=>String(s??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));const save=()=>{try{if(storageBlocked)throw Error('資料讀取異常，已停止寫入');const next=JSON.stringify(state);localStorage.setItem(KEY,next);lastSaved=next;notify('已儲存在此裝置');if(typeof dispatchEvent==='function')dispatchEvent(new Event('trip-local-save'))}catch(error){if(lastSaved)state=JSON.parse(lastSaved);notify('儲存失敗：'+error.message);throw error}};function switchTab(t){tab=t;passportVisible=false;render()}function render(){if(typeof TripMap!=='undefined')TripMap.dispose();document.getElementById('tabs').innerHTML=tabs.map(([k,n])=>`<button class="${tab===k?'active':''}" aria-current="${tab===k?'page':'false'}" onclick="switchTab('${k}')">${n}</button>`).join('');const root=document.getElementById('main');root.innerHTML=tab==='itinerary'?renderItinerary():tab==='map'?TripMap.render():tab==='dayone'?ArrivalDay.render():tab==='return'?ReturnDay.render():tab==='standby'?renderStandby():tab==='prep'?renderChecklist('prep'):tab==='arrival'?renderChecklist('arrival'):tab==='restaurants'?renderRestaurants():tab==='shopping'?renderShopping():renderEntry();if(tab==='itinerary')wireDrag();if(tab==='map')TripMap.mount(state.itinerary,id=>edit('itinerary',id),mapsHref);decoratePokemon()}
function actions(type,id){return `<button class="btn alt mini" onclick="edit('${type}','${id}')">編輯</button><button class="btn danger mini" onclick="removeItem('${type}','${id}')">刪除</button>`}function addButton(type){return `<button class="btn" onclick="edit('${type}')">＋ 新增${{itinerary:'景點',prep:'待辦',arrival:'事項',restaurants:'餐廳',shopping:'商品'}[type]}</button>`}
function normalizeMapUrl(value){
 const text=String(value??'').trim();if(!text)return '';
 let url;try{url=new URL(text)}catch{throw Error('請貼上完整的 Google Maps 網址（https://…）')}
 const host=url.hostname.toLowerCase();const short=host==='maps.app.goo.gl'||host==='goo.gl'&&/^\/maps(?:\/|$)/.test(url.pathname);
 const mapsHost=/^maps\.google\.(com|com\.tw|co\.jp)$/.test(host);
 const googleMaps=/^(www\.)?google\.(com|com\.tw|co\.jp)$/.test(host)&&/^\/maps(?:\/|$)/.test(url.pathname);
 if(url.protocol!=='https:'||url.username||url.password||url.port||!(short||mapsHost||googleMaps)||text.length>4096)throw Error('請使用 Google Maps 分享網址，例如 maps.app.goo.gl 或 www.google.com/maps');
 return url.href;
}
function mapsHref(item){try{const link=normalizeMapUrl(item.mapUrl);if(link)return link}catch{/* Invalid imported links never become clickable. */}return 'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query='+encodeURIComponent([item.name,item.area,'日本'].filter(Boolean).join(' '))}
function mapButton(item){return `<a class="btn alt mini map-link" href="${esc(mapsHref(item))}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="在 Google Maps 開啟 ${esc(item.name)}">Google Maps ↗</a>`}
function itineraryCard(item,standby=false){return `<div class="item row itinerary-item" data-id="${item.id}" draggable="false">${standby?'':`<button type="button" class="handle" aria-label="拖曳排序；也可透過編輯變更日期" title="拖曳排序">☰</button>`}<div class="grow"><div class="itemTitle">${esc(item.name)}</div><span class="pill">${esc(item.area)}</span><div class="muted">${esc(item.note)}</div></div><div class="itinerary-actions">${mapButton(item)}${actions('itinerary',item.id)}${standby?'':`<button class="btn alt mini" onclick="moveToStandby('${item.id}')">移到備用行程</button>`}</div>${standby?`<div class="schedule-row"><label for="schedule_${item.id}">安排日期</label><select id="schedule_${item.id}" aria-label="將 ${esc(item.name)} 排入某一天" onchange="scheduleItinerary('${item.id}',this.value)"><option value="">選擇日期並移入行程</option>${days.map(day=>`<option value="${esc(day)}">${esc(day)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div>`:''}</div>`}
function renderItinerary(){return `<div class="card"><b>每日動態行程</b><p class="note">按住左側 ☰ 拖曳排序或跨日移動，也可在「編輯」變更日期。未定日期的景點先放「備用行程」。Google Maps 可開啟自訂網址；未填網址時以名稱搜尋。</p><div class="toolbar"><select aria-label="篩選行程日期" onchange="dayFilter=this.value;render()"><option value="all">顯示全部日期</option>${days.map(day=>`<option ${dayFilter===day?'selected':''}>${day}</option>`).join('')}</select>${addButton('itinerary')}</div></div>`+days.filter(day=>dayFilter==='all'||day===dayFilter).map(day=>`<div class="day" data-day="${day}"><strong>${day}</strong><div class="muted">${state.itinerary.filter(item=>item.day===day).length} 個項目 · 可拖曳卡片到此日期</div></div><div class="dropzone" data-day="${day}">${state.itinerary.filter(item=>item.day===day).map(item=>itineraryCard(item)).join('')}</div>`).join('')}
function renderStandby(){const items=state.itinerary.filter(item=>item.day===UNSCHEDULED);return `<div class="card"><div class="row"><div class="grow"><h3>備用行程</h3><div class="stat">${items.length} 個待安排景點</div></div>${addButton('itinerary')}</div><p class="note">先收藏想去的地點，確定日期後選擇「安排日期」，就會移入當天行程。也可在「編輯」修改 Google Maps 網址或日期。</p></div>`+(items.map(item=>itineraryCard(item,true)).join('')||'<div class="empty">還沒有備用行程。點「新增景點」收藏想去的地方。</div>')}
function scheduleItinerary(id,day){if(!days.includes(day))return;const item=state.itinerary.find(item=>item.id===id);if(!item||item.day!==UNSCHEDULED)return;moveItem(id,day);render();notify('已排入 '+day+'，可到「行程」查看')}

function renderChecklist(type){let items=state[type],done=items.filter(x=>x.done).length;return `<div class="card"><div class="row"><div class="grow"><h3>${type==='prep'?'出發前準備清單':'12/03 抵達日本執行清單'}</h3><div class="stat">已完成 ${done} / ${items.length}</div></div>${addButton(type)}</div></div>`+items.map(x=>`<div class="item row"><input class="check" type="checkbox" style="width:20px" ${x.done?'checked':''} onchange="toggle('${type}','${x.id}',this.checked)"><div class="grow ${x.done?'done':''}"><div class="itemTitle">${esc(x.name)}</div><div class="muted">${esc(x.area)}</div></div>${actions(type,x.id)}</div>`).join('')}
function renderRestaurants(){return '<div class="card"><h3>餐廳收藏庫</h3><p class="note">填入 Google Maps 分享網址，選擇日期即可加入當日行程；收藏資料仍會保留。</p>'+addButton('restaurants')+'</div>'+state.restaurants.map(x=>`<div class="item"><div class="itemTitle">${esc(x.name)}</div><span class="pill">${esc(x.area)}</span><p>${esc(x.cuisine)}</p><p class="note">${esc(x.note)}</p><div class="toolbar">${mapButton(x)}${actions('restaurants',x.id)}</div><label>安排到行程<select aria-label="安排餐廳日期" onchange="scheduleRestaurant('${x.id}',this.value);this.value=''"><option value="">選擇日期</option>${[UNSCHEDULED,...days].map(d=>`<option value="${esc(d)}">${d===UNSCHEDULED?'備用行程':esc(d)}</option>`).join('')}</select></label></div>`).join('')}
function scheduleRestaurant(id,day){
 if(![UNSCHEDULED,...days].includes(day))return;
 const restaurant=state.restaurants.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!restaurant)return;
 const targetId='restaurant-'+id;
 const existing=state.itinerary.find(x=>x.id===targetId);
 if(existing){moveItem(targetId,day)}else{state.itinerary.push({id:targetId,name:restaurant.name,area:restaurant.area||'',note:[restaurant.cuisine,restaurant.note].filter(Boolean).join(' · '),mapUrl:restaurant.mapUrl||'',day});save()}
 render();notify('已安排到 '+(day===UNSCHEDULED?'備用行程':day)+'，餐廳收藏已保留');
}
function moveToStandby(id){moveItem(id,UNSCHEDULED);render();notify('已移到備用行程')}

function renderShopping(){let sum=state.shopping.reduce((s,x)=>s+(Number(x.price)||0)*(Number(x.qty??1)||0),0);return `<div class="card"><div class="row"><div class="grow"><h3>購物清單</h3><div class="stat">預估總額 ¥${sum.toLocaleString()}（僅計已填單價）</div></div>${addButton('shopping')}</div></div>`+state.shopping.map(x=>`<div class="item row"><input class="check" type="checkbox" style="width:20px" ${x.done?'checked':''} onchange="toggle('shopping','${x.id}',this.checked)"><div class="grow ${x.done?'done':''}"><div class="itemTitle">${esc(x.name)}</div><div class="muted">${esc(x.area)} · ${esc(x.place)} · ${esc(x.qty??1)} 件 · ¥${Number(x.price||0).toLocaleString()}/件</div><div class="note">${esc(x.note)}</div></div>${actions('shopping',x.id)}</div>`).join('')}
function clip(s){if(navigator.clipboard?.writeText){navigator.clipboard.writeText(s).then(()=>alert('已複製'),()=>fallbackCopy(s))}else fallbackCopy(s)}function fallbackCopy(s){const a=document.createElement('textarea');a.value=s;document.body.append(a);a.select();document.execCommand('copy');a.remove();alert('已複製')}
function entryLine(title,value,copy=false){return `<div class="detail"><span>${esc(title)}</span><div>${esc(value||'待填寫')}${copy&&value?`<button class="copybtn" data-copy="${esc(value)}" onclick="clip(this.dataset.copy)">複製</button>`:''}</div></div>`}
function renderEntry(){const address='25-3 Motogiku-machi, Kanazawa-shi, Ishikawa-ken 920-0036, Japan';const ja='〒920-0036 石川県金沢市元菊町25-3';return `<div class="card"><h3>🛂 Visit Japan Web／入境資料備用</h3><p class="note">以下資料可在無網路時直接查看。護照資訊請依最新有效護照逐字填入，尤其 旅客 2 的換發新護照。英文字母、證號及出生日期必須與證件完全一致。</p><div class="warning">⚠️ 敏感資料提醒：此頁儲存於目前瀏覽器的 localStorage；匯出 JSON 備份也會包含完整護照資料。建議僅在私人裝置使用，不要將含護照號碼的備份放到公開 GitHub 或分享給其他人。</div><div class="toolbar"><button class="btn alt" onclick="passportVisible=!passportVisible;render()">${passportVisible?'🙈 隱藏護照號碼':'👁️ 顯示護照號碼'}</button></div></div>
${state.passports.map((p,i)=>`<div class="card"><div class="row"><h3 class="grow">${esc(p.label)} 的護照</h3><button class="btn alt mini" onclick="editPassport(${i})">編輯資料</button></div>${entryLine('護照英文姓名',p.englishName,true)}${entryLine('護照號碼',p.passportNumber?(passportVisible?p.passportNumber:'••••••••'):'待填寫',passportVisible)}${entryLine('出生日期',p.birthDate,true)}${entryLine('有效期限',p.expiryDate,true)}${entryLine('國籍代碼',p.nationality||'TWN',true)}${entryLine('性別',p.sex||'待填寫')}</div>`).join('')}
<div class="card"><h3>🏨 日本住宿地址 — INOVA Kanazawa</h3>${entryLine('飯店名稱','INOVA Kanazawa',true)}${entryLine('都道府縣','Ishikawa（石川縣）',true)}${entryLine('市區町村','Kanazawa-shi（金澤市）',true)}${entryLine('郵遞區號','920-0036',true)}${entryLine('日文地址',ja,true)}${entryLine('英文完整地址',address,true)}${entryLine('電話（日本國內）','076-223-3133',true)}${entryLine('電話（國際格式）','+81-76-223-3133',true)}${entryLine('入住日','2026-12-03',true)}${entryLine('退房日','2026-12-10',true)}${entryLine('住宿晚數','7',true)}<div class="toolbar"><a class="btn" style="text-decoration:none" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=INOVA%20Kanazawa%2025-3%20Motogiku" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Maps ↗</a><a class="btn alt" style="text-decoration:none" href="https://www.kanazawahotel.jp/access.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">飯店官網 ↗</a></div><p class="muted">入住資料請以個人訂房確認信為準；上述地址與電話採飯店官網資料。</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>✈️ 航班與日本入境資訊</h3>${entryLine('抵達日本','2026-12-03',true)}${entryLine('入境班機','CI370',true)}${entryLine('入境機場','Toyama Airport（富山機場）',true)}${entryLine('回程日期','2026-12-10',true)}${entryLine('回程班機','CI371',true)}${entryLine('旅遊目的','Tourism / Sightseeing（觀光）',true)}<p class="note">Visit Japan Web 官方網站：<a href="https://www.vjw.digital.go.jp/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">前往填寫</a>。此頁僅供備用查閱，不會自動上傳至日本入境系統。</p></div>`}
function editPassport(i){const p=state.passports[i];document.getElementById('editorTitle').textContent='編輯 '+p.label+' 護照資料';const f=[['englishName','護照英文姓名（依護照）','text'],['passportNumber','護照號碼','text'],['birthDate','出生日期','date'],['expiryDate','護照有效期限','date'],['nationality','國籍代碼','text'],['sex','性別（M/F/X，依護照）','text']];document.getElementById('editForm').innerHTML=f.map(([k,label,type])=>`<label for="p_${k}">${label}</label><input id="p_${k}" name="${k}" type="${type}" autocomplete="off" value="${esc(p[k]||'')}">`).join('')+'<div class="toolbar"><button class="btn" type="submit">儲存</button><button type="button" class="btn alt" onclick="document.getElementById(\'editor\').close()">取消</button></div>';document.getElementById('editForm').onsubmit=e=>{e.preventDefault();Object.assign(p,Object.fromEntries(new FormData(e.target)));save();document.getElementById('editor').close();render()};document.getElementById('editor').showModal();decoratePokemon(document.getElementById('editor'))}
function toggle(type,id,v){const x=state[type].find(x=>x.id===id);if(x){x.done=v;save();render()}}function removeItem(type,id){if(!confirm('確定刪除此項目？'))return;state[type]=state[type].filter(x=>x.id!==id);save();render()}
const fields={itinerary:[['name','景點／活動名稱'],['area','地區'],['day','日期','day'],['mapUrl','Google Maps 網址（選填）','url'],['note','備註','textarea']],prep:[['name','待辦事項'],['area','分類']],arrival:[['name','執行事項'],['area','分類']],restaurants:[['name','餐廳名稱'],['area','地區','area'],['cuisine','料理類型'],['mapUrl','Google Maps 網址（選填）','url'],['note','營業時間／備註','textarea']],shopping:[['name','商品名稱'],['area','分類'],['place','預計購買地點'],['qty','數量','number'],['price','單價（日圓）','number'],['note','備註','textarea']]};function edit(type,id){
 const old=state[type].find(item=>item.id===id)||{};const selectedDay=old.day||(tab==='standby'?UNSCHEDULED:dayFilter==='all'?days[0]:dayFilter);
 document.getElementById('editorTitle').textContent=(id?'編輯':'新增')+({itinerary:'行程',prep:'待辦',arrival:'抵達事項',restaurants:'餐廳',shopping:'購物商品'}[type]);
 document.getElementById('editForm').innerHTML=fields[type].map(([key,label,kind])=>`<label for="f_${key}">${label}</label>`+(kind==='day'?`<select id="f_${key}" name="${key}">${[UNSCHEDULED,...days].map(day=>`<option value="${esc(day)}" ${selectedDay===day?'selected':''}>${day===UNSCHEDULED?'備用行程（日期未定）':esc(day)}</option>`).join('')}</select>`:kind==='area'?`<select id="f_${key}" name="${key}">${['金澤','能登','富山','小矢部','福井','白川鄉','其他'].map(area=>`<option ${old[key]===area?'selected':''}>${area}</option>`).join('')}</select>`:kind==='textarea'?`<textarea id="f_${key}" name="${key}" rows="3">${esc(old[key])}</textarea>`:`<input id="f_${key}" name="${key}" type="${kind==='number'?'number':kind==='url'?'url':'text'}" ${kind==='number'?'min="0"':''} ${kind==='url'?'placeholder="https://maps.app.goo.gl/…" inputmode="url" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false"':''} value="${esc(old[key]??'')}" ${key==='name'?'required':''}>`)).join('')+`<div class="toolbar"><button type="submit" class="btn">儲存</button><button type="button" class="btn alt" onclick="document.getElementById('editor').close()">取消</button></div>`;
 document.getElementById('editForm').onsubmit=event=>{
  event.preventDefault();const data=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(event.target).entries());if(!data.name?.trim())return;
  if(type==='restaurants'){try{data.mapUrl=normalizeMapUrl(data.mapUrl)}catch(error){notify(error.message);return}}
  if(type==='itinerary'){try{data.mapUrl=normalizeMapUrl(data.mapUrl)}catch(error){notify(error.message);return}if(![UNSCHEDULED,...days].includes(data.day)){notify('請選擇有效日期或備用行程');return}}
  const item={...old,...data,id:id||uid()};if(!id){if(['prep','arrival','shopping'].includes(type))item.done=false;state[type].push(item)}else Object.assign(old,item);
  save();document.getElementById('editor').close();render();
 };
 document.getElementById('editor').showModal();decoratePokemon(document.getElementById('editor'));
}

function moveItem(id,day,targetId=null,after=false){
 const item=state.itinerary.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!item||id===targetId||![UNSCHEDULED,...days].includes(day))return;
 const rest=state.itinerary.filter(x=>x.id!==id);let index=rest.findIndex(x=>x.id===targetId);
 if(index<0){const last=rest.map(x=>x.day).lastIndexOf(day);index=last<0?rest.length:last+1}else if(after)index++;
 item.day=day;rest.splice(index,0,item);state.itinerary=rest;save();
}
function wireDrag(){
 document.querySelectorAll('.handle').forEach(handle=>{
 let drag=null,frame=0;
 const clear=()=>{cancelAnimationFrame(frame);if(drag){drag.card.classList.remove('dragging');drag.ghost?.remove()}document.querySelectorAll('.dragtarget').forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('dragtarget'));drag=null;document.body.classList.remove('is-dragging')};
 const hit=()=>{if(!drag)return;document.querySelectorAll('.dragtarget').forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('dragtarget'));const at=document.elementFromPoint(drag.x,drag.y);const target=at?.closest('.item');const zone=at?.closest('.dropzone,.day');drag.target=target;drag.zone=zone;(target||zone)?.classList.add('dragtarget');};
 const tick=()=>{if(!drag?.active)return;const top=document.getElementById('tabs').getBoundingClientRect().bottom+55;const bottom=innerHeight-document.querySelector('.footer').getBoundingClientRect().height-55;const delta=drag.y<top?-Math.min(16,(top-drag.y)/5):drag.y>bottom?Math.min(16,(drag.y-bottom)/5):0;if(delta)window.scrollBy(0,delta);hit();frame=requestAnimationFrame(tick)};
 handle.addEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{if(e.button!==0||!e.isPrimary)return;clear();const card=handle.closest('.item');drag={id:card.dataset.id,card,x:e.clientX,y:e.clientY,sx:e.clientX,sy:e.clientY,active:false,pointer:e.pointerId};handle.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);e.preventDefault()});
 handle.addEventListener('pointermove',e=>{if(!drag||e.pointerId!==drag.pointer)return;drag.x=e.clientX;drag.y=e.clientY;if(!drag.active&&Math.hypot(drag.x-drag.sx,drag.y-drag.sy)>7){drag.active=true;drag.card.classList.add('dragging');document.body.classList.add('is-dragging');const ghost=drag.card.cloneNode(true);ghost.removeAttribute('data-id');ghost.className='drag-ghost';ghost.style.width=Math.min(drag.card.offsetWidth,320)+'px';ghost.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');document.body.append(ghost);drag.ghost=ghost;frame=requestAnimationFrame(tick)}if(drag.active){e.preventDefault();drag.ghost.style.transform='translate('+Math.max(8,Math.min(innerWidth-328,drag.x-90))+'px,'+(drag.y+18)+'px)';hit()}});
 handle.addEventListener('pointerup',e=>{if(!drag)return;const d=drag;hit();const day=d.zone?.dataset.day;const target=d.target;const after=target&&e.clientY>target.getBoundingClientRect().top+target.offsetHeight/2;clear();if(d.active&&day){moveItem(d.id,day,target?.dataset.id,after);render();notify('已移動到 '+day)}});
 handle.addEventListener('pointercancel',clear);handle.addEventListener('lostpointercapture',clear);
 handle.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(!['ArrowUp','ArrowDown','Escape'].includes(e.key))return;if(e.key==='Escape'){clear();return}e.preventDefault();const id=handle.closest('.item').dataset.id;const visible=[...document.querySelectorAll('.item[data-id]')];const index=visible.findIndex(x=>x.dataset.id===id);const target=visible[index+(e.key==='ArrowDown'?1:-1)];if(target){moveItem(id,target.closest('.dropzone').dataset.day,target.dataset.id,e.key==='ArrowDown');render();document.querySelector('[data-id="'+id+'"] .handle')?.focus()}});
 });
}

function exportData(){if(storageBlocked){const raw=localStorage.getItem(KEY);if(raw!==null)downloadBackup(raw,'hokuriku-recovery.json');return;}if(!confirm('備份可能包含護照、出生日期等個資，請保存在私人位置。繼續匯出？'))return;const blob=new Blob([JSON.stringify({version:1,exportedAt:new Date().toISOString(),data:state},null,2)],{type:'application/json'});const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='hokuriku-trip-backup.json';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000)}async function importData(e){const file=e.target.files[0];if(!file)return;try{
 if(storageBlocked)throw Error('請先排除原始資料讀取問題，避免覆寫');
 if(file.size>5*1024*1024)throw Error('檔案超過 5 MB');
 const obj=JSON.parse(await file.text());if(obj.version!==undefined&&obj.version!==1)throw Error('不支援的備份版本');
 const data=validate(obj.data||obj);if(!confirm('還原將取代目前資料。繼續前會自動下載目前資料的備份，請確認已保存。'))return;
 downloadBackup(JSON.stringify({version:1,exportedAt:new Date().toISOString(),data:state},null,2),'hokuriku-before-restore.json');
 const next=structuredClone(data);delete next._cloudSync;if(state._cloudSync)next._cloudSync=structuredClone(state._cloudSync);if(!Array.isArray(next.passports))next.passports=structuredClone(passportDefaults);
 state=next;save();passportVisible=false;render();notify('還原完成，原資料備份已下載');
 }catch(error){notify('匯入失敗：'+error.message)}finally{e.target.value=''}}
function downloadBackup(text,name){const url=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([text],{type:'application/json'}));const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download=name;a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000)}
addEventListener('offline',()=>notify('目前離線，仍可編輯與儲存；外部地圖需要網路'));
addEventListener('online',()=>notify('網路已連線'));
document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',()=>{if(document.hidden){passportVisible=false;if(tab==='entry')render()}});
addEventListener('storage',e=>{if(e.key===KEY){storageBlocked=true;notify('另一視窗已更新資料；請重新載入後繼續，避免覆寫。')}});
if('serviceWorker' in navigator && location.protocol!=='file:')navigator.serviceWorker.register('./sw.js').then(reg=>{if(reg.waiting)notify('新版已下載，關閉所有此 App 視窗後重開即可更新');reg.addEventListener('updatefound',()=>{const worker=reg.installing;worker?.addEventListener('statechange',()=>{if(worker.state==='installed')notify(navigator.serviceWorker.controller?'新版已備妥，關閉 App 後重開更新':'離線快取已備妥')})})}).catch(()=>notify('離線快取未完成，請連線重新開啟'));

